  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young African Leaders Initiative (YALI)-SANUVA Waster Management Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SANUVA is the first waste management venture in Mali which aims to tackle the urban proliferation of abandoned waste as well as urban sanitation. the company collects, sorts and recycles waste in Mali. The goal is to invest in buying new materials of waste recycling such as a sorting machine and hire new employees in order to boost the productivity.</narrative>
  </description>
